%% alt: Mind map of CSV and Excel pitfalls. Delimiter: semicolon instead of comma, decimal comma, thousands separator. Encoding: byte order mark, cp1256, mojibake. Quoting: comma inside text, newline inside a field, doubled quotes. Header: title rows, no header, duplicate names. Types: IDs lose zeros, n/a markers, mixed date formats. Excel: serial dates, merged cells, formulas without cached values.
mindmap
  root((Flat file pitfalls))
    Delimiter
      semicolon not comma
      decimal comma
      thousands separator
    Encoding
      byte order mark
      cp1256 or UTF-8
      mojibake
    Quoting
      comma inside text
      newline inside a field
      doubled quote marks
    Header
      title rows above it
      no header at all
      duplicate names
    Types
      IDs lose leading zeros
      markers like n/a or dash
      mixed date formats
    Excel
      serial number dates
      merged cells
      formulas with no value
